 d income investor calls on Monday\, September 21\, 2026\, ahead of a poten
 tial multi-tranche bond offering. The planned issuance includes a GBP-deno
 minated 144A/Reg S senior unsecured 5-year note and a USD-denominated 144A
 /Reg S senior unsecured offering across 3-year\, 5-year\, and 10-year teno
 rs\, subject to market conditions. The deal is notable in the context of N
 uveen's pending ~£9.9 billion acquisition of Schroders\, approved by share
 holders on April 16\, 2026\, and expected to close in Q4 2026\, suggesting
  acquisition financing as a likely use of proceeds.
